note Support page and CSS. Seeded Omega emits HTML on fd1 and CSS on fd4. The small header link is the only invitation; there is no banner.
note Layout: one primary action near the top, then the steps in one card with the eligibility detail folded, then other ways to help.
text supage "<section class=\"support-page\" aria-labelledby=\"support-title\"><div class=\"support-hero\"><p class=\"support-kicker\">Keep open source moving</p><h1 id=\"support-title\">Help me keep building.</h1><p class=\"support-intro\">Everything here is free and open source, and it will stay that way. I'm one person building this, and I'm running low on funds.</p><p class=\"support-intro\">If you have extra to give to the open source community, you can help me keep going through X Money.</p><div class=\"support-action\"><a class=\"support-button\" href=\"https://x.com/mdrakestapleton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Support via X Money</a><p class=\"support-note\"><strong>X Money is currently US-only.</strong> The button opens my X profile, not a payment checkout.</p></div></div><section class=\"support-card\" aria-labelledby=\"support-how\"><h2 id=\"support-how\">How to send support</h2><ol class=\"support-steps\"><li>Open X and select <strong>Money</strong>.</li><li>Choose <strong>Send Money</strong>.</li><li>Search for <strong>@mdrakestapleton</strong>, check the recipient, then choose the amount to send.</li></ol><details class=\"support-more\"><summary>Who can send through X Money</summary><p>Sending money requires an X account with access to X Money. Sending through X Money is peer-to-peer between X users, and X offers no public payment link I can put here.</p><p><a href=\"https://money.x.com/en/i/faq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read the X Money FAQ and eligibility requirements</a></p></details></section><section class=\"support-other\" aria-labelledby=\"support-other\"><h2 id=\"support-other\">Other ways to help</h2><p>If giving isn't an option, that's completely fine. Reading, trying the software, sharing a useful page or contributing a fix helps too. Nothing here is gated on a donation.</p><p class=\"support-links\"><a href=\"/alpha/\">Try Sovereign Intelligence</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Get in touch</a><a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev\">Explore the source</a></p></section></section>\n"
text sucss ".support-button,.aien-support-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid var(--accent-green,#00e599);border-radius:999px;padding:.65rem 1.1rem;color:var(--text-primary,#f5f7fb);background:var(--bg-surface,#111722);font-weight:650;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.support-button:hover,.aien-support-button:hover{background:var(--bg-card-hover,#1b2433)}.support-button:focus-visible,.aien-support-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-green,#00e599);outline-offset:4px}.aien-support-button{padding:.25rem .7rem;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1);background:transparent;border-color:var(--border-subtle,#2a3445)}.aien-support-button:hover{color:var(--text-primary,#f5f7fb);border-color:var(--accent-green,#00e599);background:transparent}.support-page{max-width:40rem;margin:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem) auto clamp(4rem,10vw,7rem);padding:0 1.5rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-primary,#f5f7fb)}.support-kicker{margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--accent-green,#00e599);font-family:var(--font-mono,ui-monospace,monospace);font-size:.8rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.support-page h1{margin-bottom:1.5rem;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,6vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}.support-intro{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1)}.support-intro+.support-intro{margin-top:1rem}.support-action{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.support-page .support-button{padding:.9rem 1.75rem;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--bg-base,#08090c);background:var(--accent-green,#00e599)}.support-page .support-button:hover{background:var(--accent-green,#00e599);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--accent-green-glow,rgba(0,229,153,.15))}.support-note{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--text-muted,#8ea0b5)}.support-note strong{color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1)}.support-card{margin-top:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,5rem);padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.25rem);background:var(--bg-card,#131822);border:1px solid var(--border-subtle,#1c2536);border-radius:12px}.support-page h2{margin-bottom:1.25rem;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.01em}.support-steps{display:grid;gap:1rem;list-style:none;counter-reset:step}.support-steps li{position:relative;padding-left:2.75rem;counter-increment:step}.support-steps li::before{content:counter(step);position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1.75rem;height:1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle,#1c2536);border-radius:50%;color:var(--accent-green,#00e599);font-family:var(--font-mono,ui-monospace,monospace);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65rem;text-align:center}.support-more{margin-top:1.75rem;padding-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle,#1c2536);font-size:.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1)}.support-more summary{cursor:pointer;width:max-content;max-width:100%}.support-more p{margin-top:.75rem}.support-other{margin-top:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,5rem)}.support-other p{color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1)}.support-page .support-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.75rem;margin-top:1.25rem}.support-page a:not(.support-button){color:var(--accent-blue,#7cc7ff);text-underline-offset:.2em}@media(max-width:600px){.support-page{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.support-page .support-button{align-self:stretch}}\n"
fn main to int
n = write 1 supage 0 len supage
if ne n long len supage
ret 1
end
n = write 4 sucss 0 len sucss
if ne n long len sucss
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
